{
  "description": "Q68(b): the declared event-type flow. Each group lists its event types: a schema group holds the payload kinds of schemas/<group>.schema.json, and code-only holds the types that have no schema kind. Each edge \"a -> b\" lets an event of type b follow an event of type a in one session log; it is listed under the group of a. scripts/generate.ts draws docs/event-flow.md from this file, and the e2e tests check that each observed pair is a declared edge. The edges describe a CLI session log. Some edges occur only on a failure path, such as a failed append before the floor.",
